  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "### v1.0.0 Highlights\n      - Full `Microsoft.Data.Sqlite` adapter layer\n      - `SQLiteConnection` with automatic connection lifecycle management\n      - `SQLiteUnitOfWork` for transactional grouping\n      - One-call DI registration via `AddActiveForgeSQLite()` extension method\n      - In-memory database support (`Data Source=:memory:`) ideal for unit testing",
